            {
                "entry_id": "c644f51d-fa9d-34a6-a32b-9280ea02c054",
                "word": "wheelie",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f3eef609-40ec-4c8c-b735-85068785d303",
                        "entry_id": "c644f51d-fa9d-34a6-a32b-9280ea02c054",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "wheelies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ab8ddaa5-8220-36aa-aaae-f57b79dc2021",
                        "entry_id": "c644f51d-fa9d-34a6-a32b-9280ea02c054",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An action or stunt where a bicycle, motorcycle, or other vehicle is ridden for a short period while it is standing only on its rear wheel or wheels."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "29b583cb-e694-4262-b92e-06284fa1f6db",
                                "sense_id": "ab8ddaa5-8220-36aa-aaae-f57b79dc2021",
                                "text": "Jim fell off his bike when he was trying to do a wheelie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e72814f-3113-4b12-94d8-2cd0292445e3",
                                "sense_id": "ab8ddaa5-8220-36aa-aaae-f57b79dc2021",
                                "text": "With them [bicycles], children can accomplish such unique and delightfully dangerous stunts as “wheelies”—that is, riding at a fast speed with the machine's front wheel raised completely above the ground."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "40c22e51-d7ac-4a4c-9740-a243be9be928",
                                "sense_id": "ab8ddaa5-8220-36aa-aaae-f57b79dc2021",
                                "text": "Bikes are pointing their noses in the air nowadays with the help of a new gadget called the Wheelie-Bar. By attaching the device to the rear of your cycle, you can tilt back on the hind wheel; wooden skate rollers at the end of the bar let you ride high, the way stock-car dragsters do."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ee49d2a-56f9-42d9-a66a-1e1054bc0e19",
                                "sense_id": "ab8ddaa5-8220-36aa-aaae-f57b79dc2021",
                                "text": "In keeping with his overall emphasis on skill, [Doug] Domokos says his most difficult trick is one he performs on solid ground. During the show, you'll see him pull up the front wheel of his ATV [all-terrain vehicle], then step over the handlebars and continue the wheelie while seated on the headlight."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f1e639d-8d9f-4dd2-8011-59fdfc8f662b",
                                "sense_id": "ab8ddaa5-8220-36aa-aaae-f57b79dc2021",
                                "text": "I learned how to let the clutch out slo-ow-ly so my tractor wouldn't pop a wheely and go hauling over backward."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "22117186-b584-49ee-9cd2-90ee7b8eb39e",
                                "sense_id": "ab8ddaa5-8220-36aa-aaae-f57b79dc2021",
                                "text": "The bikers pop wheelies and execute speedy figure eights along the busy street. Still, something more purposeful than joyriding would seem to be on their minds."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "599b0174-4625-3c35-b989-b717cfb27e2e",
                        "entry_id": "c644f51d-fa9d-34a6-a32b-9280ea02c054",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A wheelchair user."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Australia",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "476ee62e-2a21-4b64-9354-cf4c02329bc4",
                                "sense_id": "599b0174-4625-3c35-b989-b717cfb27e2e",
                                "text": "It is also a nightmare for the wheelies, or wheelchair users. Not only is it hard enough to find a bloody wheelchair in the airport these days, but to push them to this back-of-beyond gate is a job in itself."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "758ecc57-47a4-4b63-a49b-68a0ae655cb8",
                                "sense_id": "599b0174-4625-3c35-b989-b717cfb27e2e",
                                "text": "Of the wheelchair users, or wheelies[…], Phil is the other group leader. He has been paraplegic for about ten years. The idea of the group leaders is that they provide support and encouragement from a position of experience."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "45f55acc-d2c5-42b5-b96c-52d2ab8f4500",
                        "source_entry_id": "c644f51d-fa9d-34a6-a32b-9280ea02c054",
                        "source_sense_description": "action or stunt where a bicycle, etc., is ridden while standing only on its rear wheel or wheels",
                        "target_lang_word": "wheeling",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wheeling",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "778d60ce-efb8-333b-b896-431c03d12ec5",
                                        "entry_id": "4d643931-aa6d-3685-8676-4384b9431497",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de rouler sur la roue arrière."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Faux anglicisme"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fd353ec-5235-4f34-aaa8-d542fd3439fc",
                                                "sense_id": "778d60ce-efb8-333b-b896-431c03d12ec5",
                                                "text": "Je t’ai vu l’autre jour sur ton vélo. Un GT Timberline, hein ? Pas mal ! Je parie que tu fais pas toute la rue en wheeling? Si tu veux je te montrerai."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "076a7963-62ba-40da-88b9-800f21f528e1",
                                                "sense_id": "778d60ce-efb8-333b-b896-431c03d12ec5",
                                                "text": "Le 16 juin, à Villejean, un jeune homme de 16 ans qui effectuait un wheeling a percuté une octogénaire marchant sur la dalle Kennedy. Légèrement blessée, elle a porté plainte le lendemain et le motard a été interpellé le 19 juin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c43ab1f5-a0c4-42fd-bc26-f0697c688884",
                                                "sense_id": "778d60ce-efb8-333b-b896-431c03d12ec5",
                                                "text": "Le 27 décembre 2020 vers 6h50, DR, âgé alors de 32 ans, pilote une moto. Il est en wheeling – sur la roue arrière – lorsqu’il percute violemment un mur. Il est grièvement blessé et transporté au centre hospitalier Louis-Constant Fleming."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc98aa2b-45d3-49a0-a859-4605e96390eb",
                                                "sense_id": "778d60ce-efb8-333b-b896-431c03d12ec5",
                                                "text": "Selon les premiers éléments, le conducteur aurait fait une roue arrière (wheeling), c’est-à-dire qu’il roulait en levant la roue avant, au moment où il a heurté son ami."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90e3a10b-bbfe-3fa9-a823-a67d0b12f113",
                                        "entry_id": "4d643931-aa6d-3685-8676-4384b9431497",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de rouler sur les deux roues arrières."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Faux anglicisme"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "174c3a80-58ca-4e5b-8f7e-10cc29146388",
                        "source_entry_id": "c644f51d-fa9d-34a6-a32b-9280ea02c054",
                        "source_sense_description": "action or stunt where a bicycle, etc., is ridden while standing only on its rear wheel or wheels",
                        "target_lang_word": "roue arrière",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "roue arrière",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "025a0185-bbb2-3e23-81f4-7a98181a8bd2",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b48294-7f24-31b8-b091-c17c311b9971",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Roue placée à l'arrière d'un véhicule."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1b35359c-b941-3928-8c6f-2f2a35f7c87c",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b48294-7f24-31b8-b091-c17c311b9971",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Position d’un véhicule dans laquelle seule la ou les roues arrières sont en contact avec le sol."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8aecdffd-c552-4688-99d8-bd3489cc0205",
                                                "sense_id": "1b35359c-b941-3928-8c6f-2f2a35f7c87c",
                                                "text": "D’après les premiers éléments de l’enquête, il n’y aurait pas de témoin direct de cet effroyable accident mais certaines personnes, interrogées à proximité du lieu du drame, rapportent qu’elles ont vu une moto rouler à grande vitesse quelques minutes avant l’accident, faisant même des roues arrière."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e07a403-e01c-4d9e-bf07-dc41ad22ac68",
                                                "sense_id": "1b35359c-b941-3928-8c6f-2f2a35f7c87c",
                                                "text": "L’élu a par ailleurs expliqué qu’il ne fallait «pas parler de rodéo urbain». «Ce n’est pas le cas. Vous avez un individu qui a un comportement criminel, qui roule beaucoup trop vite et qui fait une roue arrière sur une route très fréquentée», a-t-il précisé. En juin, l’édile avait constaté ce phénomène de «rodéos urbains», avec des véhicules sur les trottoirs, lors d’un mariage, qu’il avait fini par annuler."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9a1bff5-1b77-340b-a5dc-1efe8c2e492d",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b48294-7f24-31b8-b091-c17c311b9971",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Figure acrobatique consistant à conduire un véhicule à deux-roues, en équilibre sur la roue arrière."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Sports mécaniques"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b088e6fd-90c3-4745-bf2d-9113d9bbaa8f",
                                                "sense_id": "d9a1bff5-1b77-340b-a5dc-1efe8c2e492d",
                                                "text": "Là, sur la route, face au petit immeuble de quatre étages, un garçon fait le beau, en roue arrière sur son scooter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
